            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><i class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block"></i> Terra (PE)</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><i class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block"></i> Retorno (R)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-slate-400">Dica: Quando energizado, clique nos interruptores na tela para acionar as cargas!</span>
        </div>
